tware; and short-term and long-term rental of new and refurbished ICT hardware and software, as well as value-added ICT services, such as managed services to provide maintenance and technical support services. It also provides ICT services comprising maintenance and technical support; proactive and analytical services for devices; data backup and device recovery; security management; CNCS; and refurbishment services. In addition, the company offers infrastructure-as-a-service (IaaS) and platform-as-a-service (PaaS); and technology financing services. Further, the company is involved in the trading, repairing, and servicing of computers and related parts and accessories; management of investment schemes; leasing and factoring facilities services; training and consultancy; and software distribution and development services. ICT Zone Asia Berhad was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"ICT Zone Asia Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，为马来西亚的私营企业和政府机构提供信息与通信技术（ICT）解决方案。公司成立于2000年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡。","lines":["技术融资：提供技术融资服务，帮助客户获取ICT设备。","ICT硬件和软件贸易：销售笔记本电脑、台式机、显示器、投影仪及外围设备，以及操作系统、杀毒软件、应用软件和设备管理软件。","ICT服务：提供维护和技术支持、设备主动分析服务、数据备份和设备恢复、安全管理、CNCS和翻新服务。","云解决方案和服务：提供基础设施即服务（IaaS）和平台即服务（PaaS）。","ICT硬件和软件租赁：提供新设备和翻新设备的短期和长期租赁，以及托管服务等增值ICT服务。"],"lines_en":["Technology Financing: Provides technology financing services to help customers acquire ICT equipment.","Trading of ICT Hardware and Software: Sells laptops, desktops, monitors, projectors, peripheral devices, operating systems, antivirus and security software, application software, and device management software.","Provision of ICT Services: Offers maintenance and technical support, proactive and analytical device services, data backup and device recovery, security management, CNCS, and refurbishment services.","Provision of Cloud Solution and Services: Provides infrastructure-as-a-service (IaaS) and platform-as-a-service (PaaS).","ICT Hardware and Software Rental: Offers short-term and long-term rental of new and refurbished ICT hardware and software, as well as value-added ICT services such as managed services."]}}